   5:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   * @brief   LPTIM HAL module driver.
   6:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *          functionalities of the Low Power Timer (LPTIM) peripheral:
   8:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions.
   9:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *           + Start/Stop operation functions in polling mode.
  10:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *           + Start/Stop operation functions in interrupt mode.
  11:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *           + Reading operation functions.
  12:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *           + Peripheral State functions.
  13:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_lptim.c ****   *
